"About tech note" = "Technical notes: traffic figures come from the system nettop interface (kernel counters, same source as Activity Monitor); local SQLite storage, zero third-party dependencies; the interface ships in Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese, Spanish and more (switchable in General); appearance follows system, light or dark.";
